WEBVTT

00:04:58.133 --> 00:05:00.304
they will make us better people.

00:05:00.673 --> 00:05:03.117
There have been some hardships, Abuelita.

00:05:03.141 --> 00:05:04.547
Out there in the world,

00:05:04.571 --> 00:05:07.807
people expect us kids to know everything,

00:05:07.831 --> 00:05:09.544
or at least they want us to.

00:05:09.568 --> 00:05:12.391
They ask questions and I give answers,

00:05:12.415 --> 00:05:14.950
as if I really knew how the world works.

00:05:14.974 --> 00:05:17.111
They want hope, and we give it.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:23.903
I have organized, written, spoken
and read about climate and policy

00:05:23.927 --> 00:05:26.260
almost every day for the past year.

00:05:27.204 --> 00:05:28.950
And I'm just a little worried

00:05:28.974 --> 00:05:31.365
that I won't be able
to do enough, Abuelita.